Return a JSON object with this exact structure:
{
  "overview": "Brief overall description of the video content",
  "location": "Where the video was filmed (if identifiable)",
  "timeOfDay": "Approximate time of day (morning/afternoon/evening/night)",
  "segments": [
    {
      "startTime": "MM:SS",
      "endTime": "MM:SS",
      "description": "What happens in this segment",
      "qualityNotes": "Notable technical issues if any (shaky, dark, overexposed, out of focus, etc.)",
      "speechContent": "Brief transcription or description of speech if any"
    }
  ],
  "highlights": [
    {
      "startTime": "MM:SS",
      "endTime": "MM:SS",
      "reason": "Why this moment is noteworthy"
    }
  ],
  "technicalNotes": "Any notable technical issues affecting the entire video"
}

Be precise with timestamps. Identify all distinct segments, even brief ones. Mark highlights that would make good cuts for an edited vlog.